  "prediction": "The meeting discussed the progress of experiments on noise robustness and the performance of different feature extraction methods, including Mel Frequency Cepstral Coefficients (MFCC) and Multi-resolution Spectral Features (MSG). The team presented results showing that adding MSG features did not improve the performance in the matched condition for Italian speech recognition, but did improve the performance when combined with PLP features. The team also discussed the need to focus on the core issues of training targets and noises, and to cut down on the number of experiments to be conducted. Additionally, the team discussed the integration with the OGI group and the possibility of using their multi-resolution spectral features. The meeting concluded with a discussion on the next steps and the need to prioritize the most important tasks.",
